{"id":"471107","name":"鱼糕蒸蛋","author":"早渔人家","authorId":"11530553","desc":"","cover":"images/471107/cover.png","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"早渔人家荆州鱼糕","amount":"2片"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"荆州鱼糕切成1cm的立方块。","img":"images/471107/step_1.png"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋好不好，新不新鲜，摇一摇就知道。","img":"images/471107/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"两个鸡蛋打到碗里。","img":"images/471107/step_3.png"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋液顺着一个方向搅打均匀。","img":"images/471107/step_4.png"},{"step":5,"desc":"按照1：2的比例，加入适量清水。","img":"images/471107/step_5.png"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量食盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/471107/step_6.png"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡蛋液倒入蒸碗中。","img":"images/471107/step_7.png"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入二十颗左右的鱼糕粒。","img":"images/471107/step_8.png"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒸锅提前预热。","img":"images/471107/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蒸锅，蒸5分钟。","img":"images/471107/step_10.png"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上葱花，就可开吃了。","img":"images/471107/step_11.png"},{"step":12,"desc":"来来来~张嘴，我喂你呀。","img":"images/471107/step_12.png"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}